    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'Dr. Milo: The results are in! Let''s see...'
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 920aa638-5dd5-4594-b0a5-00c4f4dab7d2
    Position: {x: 1652, y: 592}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Ding ding ding! We have an unmistakable match!
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 2f69dc8d-6744-4fb8-9cd8-8d925e6d5ee3
    Position: {x: 1911, y: 592}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'Findus: Gah! Technology these days is getting too good.
        Guess the gig is up...'
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 1ec5d9d6-2122-4d97-a9a3-7f457fc4c961
    Position: {x: 884, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'Yes, I did steal his stupid flower. Someone had to teach
        that cat a lesson! '
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 2d32b667-db15-4a1c-8264-c741ebf205b7
    Position: {x: 1145, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'He deserved it and then some!

        He and his band
        of orange misfits came waltzing into this town thinking they own the place!'
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 08c69361-8395-498d-9c9f-7aefe5c3b11a
    Position: {x: 1403, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: And now they are going after our jobs! I own a farm not
        far from here, and I hear their company is going to undercut our market with
        cheap importeds!
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: c4324a8e-98b3-4f8a-8c51-cd5ec2d87c3b
    Position: {x: 1652, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Those orange cats, they are different. They are not from
        here. They don't think like us. I say we kick them out for good.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: f7269a0e-a126-4f38-a14f-ac983946e736
    Position: {x: 1911, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Sorry for the yapping Detective. I just want things to
        go back to what it was...
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 878519c4-1d72-4930-bb25-715a15143d0e
    Position: {x: 2515, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Where was I last night? Back home at my farm. Can't be
        gone too long, you know. Lots of work to be done after all!
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 9fbeedaf-cba7-4617-a759-260f0aaeb8ac
    Position: {x: 2772, y: 911}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: FindusMiloDialogueEvent
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: If there's anything more, you'll find me back in the Cattelatte.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
